  "description": "\"From here on out I'll try and look for a bride. Please just help me prepare for the wedding.\"  \nGeumyoung, a wedding planner of seven years, ended up in charge of his very last customer, Jeong Hanho, who gives him an incomprehensible request. Unable to refuse the large deposit Hanho gave him, Geumyoung begins the preparation of Hanho's wedding without a bride. However, Hanho doesn't seem to actually be interested in finding a bride, and makes strange requests under the pretense of preparing for his wedding...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/marryOX/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/marriage_option)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/marriage_option), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.jp/comic/marriage_option)  \nOthers: [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/marry_me), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/marryOX)",
